<title>USA: Redwood Trust files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Redwood Trust files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>MILL VALLEY, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Trust Inc Tuesday said it filed  a universal shelf registration with the the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $200 million in securities.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it may offer common stock, preferred stock, warrants and shareholder rights from time to time, subject to specific terms.</p>
<p>Currently, the company has outstanding 8,783,641 shares of common stock, 1,362,257 warrants and 1,006,250 shares of Class B cumulative convertible preferred stock.</p>
